WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
It’s not just about combat effectiveness here

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,200
But one must know what each one can do

3
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,250
My ability is to make the target turn around

4
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,850
My ability is to make targets turn their backs on me

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,450
Doing plank support too

6
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:20,900
The ability does take effect

7
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,780
Help me unblock it first

8
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,360
It’s useless to look at it alone.

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,760
Combining them together can temporarily control loss.

10
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,760
This is how we escaped all the way.

11
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,140
At least you know how to cooperate
